    },
    "message": "feat(config): ~/.mcc default for new installs; ~/.fcc stays legacy, opt-in migrate\n\nNew installs keep their configuration in ~/.mcc. The pre-6.40.0 ~/.fcc home\nstays fully supported and is never moved, renamed, or written to on its own:\nan existing ~/.fcc keeps working until the user opts in via mcc-migrate.\nOne function (config/paths.py::config_dir_path) decides the directory, cached\nper process; every consumer goes through it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AxhmPc42yZ6wMyomxP3Ty6",
