    "message": "fix(config-dir): test stubs, ty, and an indentation bug in env_files\n\n- installer test fake_uv now stages mcc-migrate and writes it to the\n  uv-receipt, so the post-install verify loop sees it.\n- ty: legacy-health assertions now check  before accessing\n  failed_check; the env-mocking test patches config.settings.Settings\n  (the defining module) instead of reassigning a module attribute.\n- env_files.py: __repr__ of LazyEnvFiles was indented after\n  Sequence.register at module level -> moved back into the class body.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
